#: patterns/how-to-prepare-phase-cards.php:15
msgid "Photos and product data — originals, not screenshots"
msgstr "Zdjęcia i dane produktowe — oryginały, nie zrzuty ekranu"

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-phase-cards.php:16
